  "prefLabel": "Pda 301.03 Deadweight capacity tonnage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 301.03 “Deadweight capacity tonnage” means the weight per 1000 kilograms of cargo, stores, fuel, passengers and crew carried by a vessel when the vessel is loaded to its maximum summer loadline as indicated by the draft marks on a vessel.\n\nSource. #7870, eff 4-12-03; ss by #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
